  "question": {
    "text": "Let a tangent to the curve&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>144</mn></math>&nbsp;intersect the coordinate axes at the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>. Then, the minimum length of the line segment <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is ______"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>144</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Equation of tangent at point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>sec</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>cosec</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mo>cosec</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>cot</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>cot</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></msqrt><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p>"
  }
